      "updated": 1786213288295,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Client\n1. POST /upload and get response\n8. Chunk and Uplaod to S3 and response. Retry on failed parts. If crash\nask ->uploadSvc->S3 for parts of uploadId and resume remaining. \n9. Call Upload SVC and it get etags using listenParts we dont need etag\nstoring clientSide",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "VYNHbr2e_VEwaY4KXppy4",
      "originalText": "Client\n1. POST /upload and get response\n8. Chunk and Uplaod to S3 and response. Retry on failed parts. If crash ask ->uploadSvc->S3 for parts of uploadId and resume remaining. \n9. Call Upload SVC and it get etags using listenParts we dont need etag storing clientSide",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
