      "seed": 710669360,
      "version": 1026,
      "versionNonce": 119901232,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786222509639,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "UploadSvc\n1. Authenticate, Quota, Allowed Type, Storage Limit\n2. Upload Policy -> 8MB Chunk\n3. Decide storage location i.e bukcetId and videoObjectKey\n4. Create S3 multiPartUpload(bucketId,vidObjKey)- get awsUploadId\n5. Store metadata - a. file b. uploadSession\n5. We know chunk size and awsUploadId- generateMultipartUploads\n7. return Response\n10. ListenParts to get all parts and etag. \n11. Call complete S3 with parts and etag . \n12 Mark File Status Ready adn Delete UploadSession info ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "7vk6_9PKyUCm9ObI-_d6m",
      "originalText": "UploadSvc\n1. Authenticate, Quota, Allowed Type, Storage Limit\n2. Upload Policy -> 8MB Chunk\n3. Decide storage location i.e bukcetId and videoObjectKey\n4. Create S3 multiPartUpload(bucketId,vidObjKey)- get awsUploadId\n5. Store metadata - a. file b. uploadSession\n5. We know chunk size and awsUploadId- generateMultipartUploads\n7. return Response\n10. ListenParts to get all parts and etag. \n11. Call complete S3 with parts and etag . \n12 Mark File Status Ready adn Delete UploadSession info ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
