      "updated": 1786205859501,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "        File Metadata\n| Field          |Info             |\n| -------------- | ----------------- |\n| fileId         | Permanent ID      |\n| ownerId        | Ownership         |\n| fileName       | Display           |\n| mimeType       | Display           |\n| parentFolderId | Folder hierarchy  |\n| size           | Display           |\n| storageKey     | S3 object         |\n| checksum       | Validation        |\n| createdAt      | Metadata          |\n| status         | UPLOADING / READY |\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
